75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叶澄杂画四首 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"古琴调古调，今人谁爱闻。\n独往山中去，因声寄白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叶澄杂画四首 其四","author":"顾璘","text":"平湖泻明镜，上有脩竹林。\n把酒对山月，谁同秋夜心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张水部杂咏八首 其一 柳溪","author":"顾璘","text":"春雨夜来急，溪流朝已深。\n柳丝摇浅绿，垂影到波心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张水部杂咏八首 其二 桧径","author":"顾璘","text":"苍桧夹芳径，葱茜饶佳色。\n霜天独不凋，然后知尔德。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张水部杂咏八首 其三 看竹","author":"顾璘","text":"水曹爱看竹，一日分几时。\n峨冠不须著，美酒聊自持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张水部杂咏八首 其四 蕉雨","author":"顾璘","text":"高叶战风雨，历乱不堪数。\n诗思与翩翩，坐深良独苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张水部杂咏八首 其五 荷风","author":"